       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TAXCALC.
       AUTHOR. THESIS-FIXTURE.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-GROSS-INCOME        PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-TAXABLE-INCOME      PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-STANDARD-DEDUCTION  PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 12950.00.
       01  WS-TAX-DUE             PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3.
       01  WS-TAX-RATE            PIC V999.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           PERFORM CALCULATE-TAX
           DISPLAY 'Tax due: ' WS-TAX-DUE
           STOP RUN.

       CALCULATE-TAX.
           SUBTRACT WS-STANDARD-DEDUCTION FROM WS-GROSS-INCOME
               GIVING WS-TAXABLE-INCOME
           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN WS-TAXABLE-INCOME <= 10275
                   MOVE 0.10 TO WS-TAX-RATE
               WHEN WS-TAXABLE-INCOME <= 41775
                   MOVE 0.12 TO WS-TAX-RATE
               WHEN WS-TAXABLE-INCOME <= 89075
                   MOVE 0.22 TO WS-TAX-RATE
               WHEN OTHER
                   MOVE 0.24 TO WS-TAX-RATE
           END-EVALUATE
           COMPUTE WS-TAX-DUE = WS-TAXABLE-INCOME * WS-TAX-RATE.
